# DarkEngine6 shader permutations (D10). Release loads only these, baked by the de_shaders target.
# One permutation per line: <file under content/shaders> <entry> <stage vs|ps|cs> [NAME=VALUE,NAME=VALUE...]
# Other shader roots (folders under content/ added with addShaderRoot()) list theirs in their own
# shaders.manifest. A shader file name may be in only one root.
# Defines are sorted by name. ShaderManifestTests checks the format; Debug runs log any
# compileShaderFromContent() call whose key is missing here.

AutoExposure.hlsl VSMain vs
AutoExposure.hlsl PSReduce ps AE_REDUCE=1
AutoExposure.hlsl PSDownsample ps

BasicMesh.hlsl VSMain vs
BasicMesh.hlsl PSMain ps

BasicMeshGBuffer.hlsl VSMain vs
BasicMeshGBuffer.hlsl PSMain ps
BasicMeshGBuffer.hlsl PSMain ps DE_THERMAL=1,DE_THERMAL_HEAT=0.41
BasicMeshGBuffer.hlsl PSMain ps DE_ULTRAVIOLET=1,DE_UV_CLASS=0.00

BasicMeshGBufferInstanced.hlsl VSMain vs
BasicMeshGBufferInstanced.hlsl PSMain ps
BasicMeshGBufferInstanced.hlsl PSMain ps DE_THERMAL=1,DE_THERMAL_HEAT=0.41
BasicMeshGBufferInstanced.hlsl PSMain ps DE_ULTRAVIOLET=1,DE_UV_CLASS=0.00

BasicMeshDepthInstanced.hlsl VSMain vs

